  "description": "Jang Jae-Woong is a golden boy. Kind-hearted and sharp-eyed but somewhat ditzy, he falls in love at first sight with Sim Jae-Yul, a man he meets on campus. Everything is all well and good until Jae-Woong starts centering his life around Sim in an attempt to catch his eye…and a momentary mistake lands the two not only in a life-threatening situation, but a whirlwind relationship!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes three side story chapters.*",
